---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "August 23, 2026";
const address = "2059 Breton Road SE, Grand Rapids, MI 49546";
const phone = "616-284-1925";
const phoneHref = "tel:6162841925";
const email = "info@thehealthyroof.com";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Healthy Roof | Grand Rapids, MI"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Healthy Roof website — learn what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have."
>

  <!-- ── Header ── -->
  <section class="bg-hr-stone py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-hr-text-primary bg-hr-yellow px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-hr-text-secondary">Effective Date: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Content ── -->
  <section class="bg-hr-cream py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-hr-text-secondary leading-relaxed">

      <p class="mb-6">
        This Privacy Policy explains how Simple Companies, LLC, doing business as Healthy Roof
        ("Healthy Roof," "we," "us," or "our"), collects, uses, and protects your information when you
        visit thehealthyroof.com (the "Site") or communicate with us by phone, text/SMS, or chat.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Business:</span> Simple Companies, LLC d/b/a Healthy Roof</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Business Address:</span> {address}</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Support Email:</span> <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-hr-teal hover:text-hr-teal-dark font-medium">{email}</a></li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Phone:</span> <a href={phoneHref} class="text-hr-teal hover:text-hr-teal-dark font-medium">{phone}</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">
        When you request an instant estimate, use our chat widget, or otherwise contact us, we may
        collect:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Property address</li>
        <li>Roof/property details entered into the estimate tool</li>
        <li>Messages you send us through chat, SMS, or our contact forms</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">We use the information you provide to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>Generate and follow up on roofing estimates</li>
        <li>Contact you by phone, email, or text regarding your inquiry, appointment, or service</li>
        <li>Respond to customer service requests, including through AI-assisted chat and voice tools</li>
        <li>Improve our services and Site</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">4. SMS/Text Messaging</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        If you provide your phone number, you may receive text messages from Healthy Roof related to
        your estimate, appointment, or customer service inquiry, including messages sent through
        automated or AI-assisted systems.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>
          <span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">No mobile opt-in data or phone numbers collected for SMS consent purposes will be shared with third parties for their own marketing or promotional purposes.</span>
        </li>
        <li>You may opt out of text messages at any time by replying <span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">STOP</span>.</li>
        <li>Message and data rates may apply; message frequency varies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">5. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">
        We use third-party platforms to operate parts of our Site and business, which may include:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>An instant estimate/quoting tool (Roofle) that collects your name, address, email, and phone number to generate your estimate and pass your information to us for follow-up</li>
        <li>A customer communication platform (GoHighLevel) used to manage calls, text messages, and chat, including AI-assisted messaging</li>
        <li>Website hosting and analytics providers</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4">
        These providers process your information on our behalf and are not authorized to use it for
        their own independent marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">6. How We Share Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>With service providers who help us operate our business (see Section 5)</li>
        <li>If required by law or to protect our legal rights</li>
        <li>With your consent</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We retain your information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this
        policy, or as required by law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">8. Your Choices</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Text messages:</span> Reply STOP to any text to opt out.</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Email:</span> You may unsubscribe from marketing emails using the link provided in those emails.</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Contact us:</span> You may contact us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-hr-teal hover:text-hr-teal-dark font-medium">{email}</a> to ask about the information we have collected about you.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">9. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Our Site may use cookies or similar technologies to improve functionality and understand how
        visitors use the Site. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">10. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Our Site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with
        an updated effective date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-hr-text-primary mt-10 mb-3">12. Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="mb-1 font-semibold text-hr-text-primary">Simple Companies, LLC d/b/a Healthy Roof</p>
      <p class="mb-1">{address}</p>
      <p class="mb-1">Email: <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-hr-teal hover:text-hr-teal-dark font-medium">{email}</a></p>
      <p class="mb-4">Phone: <a href={phoneHref} class="text-hr-teal hover:text-hr-teal-dark font-medium">{phone}</a></p>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
